<title>USA: Eaton Corp Q4 shr $0.85 vs $1.16.</title>
<headline>Eaton Corp Q4 shr $0.85 vs $1.16.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.85		    $1.16</p>
<p> Net			 66,000		   90,000</p>
<p> Net Sales	    1,724,000		1,661,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  77,100		   77,600</p>
<p>	    12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $4.50		    $5.13</p>
<p> Net		 349,000		  399,000</p>
<p> Net Sales	 6,961,000		6,822,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  77,400		   77,800</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company said 1996 Q4 results were markedly affected by $29 million of restructuring charges. Excluding restructuring expenses, Q4 earnings reached about $1.15 per share, essentially equal to year-ago results.</p>
</text>
